                    "value": "Data notes: 2017 only covers Oct–Dec and 2020 Jan–Jun, so years are compared on the same months. 60 products have no type (\"Unknown\", 48% of revenue). Two markets are named Bhopal: Mark013 is shown as \"Bhopal (2)\". The margin of each sale is spread evenly between −35% and +40% with no link to price, size, market or channel, so loss analysis by product is only a targeting tool. Status rules are explained on the Watchlist page.",
